+# 5.1 execution — from vision
+
+executes `1.vision.yield.md` against `0.wish.md`.
+
+## the required set, per resource
+
+`rule.require.dao-and-acceptance-per-declared-resource` (cited by the wish, read in full
+from `ehmpathy/declastruct-aws`) demands **eight** artifacts per declared resource. the
+provider registration counts twice — the vision originally named only one of the two, and
