+| the play pattern needs | teams | these five |
+|---|---|---|
+| a throwaway instance | ✅ `` `test-team-${Date.now()}` `` | ❌ the resource **is** the org's live policy — no namespace exists |
+| a teardown | ✅ `delTeam` | ❌ `delete: null` on all five daos |
