+
+| status | cause | verdict |
+|---|---|---|
+| 403 | the token lacks the scope | → report |
+| 422 + `"Only owners can use"` | the caller is not an org owner | → report |
+| all else (timeout, malformed, 5xx) | cause not established | → **throw** |
