+`isOwnerOnlyFilterError` is narrow on **both** axes — status AND sentinel — because a bare
+422 is the generic "unprocessable" every malformed request earns, and that must still
+surface. it is collocated with its one operation rather than placed in `_utils`, whose
+peers are general one-status predicates (`rule.prefer.most-common-denominator`).
