+**why it was a blocker and not a perf note.** the wish's acceptance criterion is that an
+operator can learn who would be dropped BEFORE it happens. two reads of live membership means
+the operator can be **SHOWN one list and HANDED another** — two sources of truth for one
+decision, in the one resource whose entire job is that nobody is surprised by who gets
+removed. the window is small; "small window" is the exact shape of defect this branch exists
+to end.
